From e767d7cd32acc295b10ac36aa22882a9fa5ba627 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LT_Name <572413378@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:24:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Mukkit: headless PocketMine fork

Squashed fork changes: externally driven boot/tick, headless network and world startup, PHP shims for missing extensions, and the bridge primitives for players, worlds, chunks, entities, events, inventory, forms, containers and tiles.
